      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SAINT BREE (5) has shown good improvement at her last two starts, finishing in the money last time when 2nd at this track over 305m. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Can measure up this time. HARRY CHANA (2) was sent out long odds last time but rocketed out of the boxes with a fast early sectional and gave a sight before being swallowed up late, finishing a 4.5 lengths second (17.70) over 305m at this track. Hard to beat again. PENNY PINTO (4) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fifth (17.95) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Has a good record here including nine wins. Cannot be left out. CADILLAC LANDAU (7) must be respected despite an unplaced effort here most recently.",
